# W7d, host a (k5): hosts in stag0101 with b; its link is cut (a reconnects after 45 s (beyond the member timeout of 35 s): still host, the instance never ended).
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@80
explore mate00 yes until stage=stag0101,control
log a hosts
wander -150 -60 20 until present=2,sealed>=600
log b joined
idle until epoch>=@195
idle until epoch>=@260
log a back
wander -150 -60 20 until sealed>=2000 fail stage=stagml11
log a still hosts
